  "details": "i unmapped the capacitive sensors of my controller's joysticks because they're faulty and prevent me from using expressions properly, this is common procedure to prolong the life of failing controllers.\n\nthey are redundant with the button's capacitive sensors to trigger expressions, thus not technically \"required\"\n\nyet this pop up unnecessarily bother me every time i launch VRC\n\ni would even argue in the way of ridding of this pop up entirely, we know we're messing with our bindings, we don't need it to shove it in our face first thing every time we launch the game, an unintrusive warning in the controls menu should be more than enough, because if controls doesn't work right that probably the first place we'll look for",
